      "headline": "Senior Software Engineer at Wipro",
      "about": "I am a highly skilled and passionate professional with a strong background in Computer Science and expertise in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning. With a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science and a Postgraduate Program in Artificial Intelligence/Machine Learning from IIT Guwahati, I possess a solid foundation in both theoretical concepts and practical applications of cutting-edge technologies.\n\nThroughout my career, I have successfully completed 18 projects on my own available on my GitHub account which encompasses various aspects of Machine Learning and Deep Learning algorithms. These projects have allowed me to gain hands-on experience in solving complex problems, ranging from predictive analytics to computer vision and natural language processing. By utilizing state-of-the-art tools and frameworks, I have consistently delivered innovative solutions that drive actionable insights and optimize business processes.\n\nMy journey in the field of AI and Machine Learning has led me to explore diverse domains, including the Semiconductor industry, Medical Industry and Analytics Industry. During my tenure in a semiconductor company, I applied my expertise in developing and implementing ML/DL models on hardware platforms using specialized Machine Learning/Deep Learning compilers. This experience has provided me with a unique perspective on integrating AI capabilities into physical systems, further enhancing my skills as a versatile technologist.\n\nAdditionally, I have held the positions of Lead ML/MLOps in a prominent medtech company and as a Data Scientist in a Fortune 500 MNC, where I combined my knowledge of signal processing with Machine Learning/Deep Learning models. By leveraging advanced signal processing techniques, I optimized the performance of medical devices and implemented intelligent algorithms that revolutionized patient care. This role further solidified my understanding of the healthcare industry and the potential of AI in transforming medical practices.\n\nBeyond my technical expertise, I am a collaborative team player with exceptional communication skills. I thrive in dynamic environments that encourage innovation and foster a growth mindset. I am committed to staying updated with the latest advancements in AI and actively contribute to the field through contintuous learning, research, and participation in industry events.\n\nIf you are looking for a results-oriented professional who can effectively leverage AI and Machine Learning to drive business growth, optimize processes, and deliver impactful solutions, we can explore this.",
